{"id":"seitdem","lemma":"seitdem","pos":"conj","rank":1229,"glosses":["since, ever since","since that"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c3/De-seitdem.ogg/De-seitdem.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Seitdem ist viel passiert.","en":"A lot has happened since then.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"much, a lot"},{"g":"to happen","l":"passieren"}]},{"text":"Seitdem suche ich Arbeit.","en":"Since then I've been looking for a job.","words":[null,{"g":"to search, to look for","l":"suchen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"toil"}]},{"text":"Seitdem habe ich nichts von ihm gehört.","en":"I have heard nothing from him since then.","words":[null,{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"er"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"}]},{"text":"Niemand hat ihn mehr gesehen seitdem.","en":"Nobody has seen him ever since.","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"him"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},null]},{"text":"Hat sich seitdem irgendwas getan?","en":"Has anything changed since then?","words":[{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"oneself"},null,null,{"g":"to do","l":"tun"}]}]}